 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Bugfixes
+
+- `obj_or_str` now accepts a plain string and returns it unchanged, matching the behavior of `obj_or_id`. This fixes feature flag methods (`Account.get_feature_flag()`, `Course.get_feature_flag()`, `User.get_feature_flag()`, `FeatureFlag.delete()`, `FeatureFlag.set_feature_flag()`) rejecting string feature names.
+
